com/v/t64.5771-25/499624592_1821581412228750_6975371446439565646_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C9dBY3DAELsQ7kNvwHs_2HI&_nc_oc=AdpglGm_VId7frGoK9yBV5aGiGTJ9ZHFANdQ_H57K34X94xiLCApSvf4j6ihISDo8Cc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUcedXEIKSR9PQuIeH7IpvYRWsGwK7xE6E1VqIKzRGojQ&oe=6B103AA0"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1117519324231419", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593749142_1117519327564752_1662798546507949965_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9xNxZAma02kQ7kNvwH1mGSn&_nc_oc=AdrNFYBIfYaYpGivHwSLcZQH_37jAqupFuai-Kaub5Dh79KTonMZ6bfZicBn4fRZsIs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUOcDJoKVbln4Lj_yC_QzrnXbaM_4kx_zqqy47gd_efaA&oe=6B106834"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "4455963451383969", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622184_4455963454717302_9156679232133652083_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xCZTf2Kl6CcQ7kNvwEuLPg3&_nc_oc=AdrJShdhtVz34RKi9hXIh4i26v8Pq2aleVahycgnBPMnYI6hRxcWZGuNLKtPc2v3f48&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWeYE8tqO1CPMSKM54D7XZLLbvdvgncUj8fd1tf3N3BLA&oe=6B1043CD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Car Asphalt | Car Racing Game", "keywords": ["CarGames", "SpeedRacing", "CarRacingGame", "SportsCarRacing"], "long_description": "# Car Asphalt | Car Racing Game \ud83c\udfce\ufe0f\ud83c\udfc1\n\n**Start your engine, feel the speed, and race your way to victory!**\n\nWelcome to **Car Asphalt**, an exciting 3D car racing game where speed, driving skills, and competition come together for an action-packed racing experience!\n\nGet behind the wheel of powerful racing cars, compete against rival drivers, and experience the excitement of high-speed car races on challenging tracks. Whether you're a casual player or a passionate racing game fan, Car Asphalt brings thrilling driving action right to your screen.\n\n## \ud83c\udfc1 Experience Real Car Racing Excitement!\n\nDo you love car games, sports car racing games, or exciting driving challenges? Car Asphalt lets you enjoy competitive races where every turn matters and every second counts.\n\nAccelerate through racing circuits, take on challenging corners, overtake opponents, and push your driving skills to the limit. Stay focused, maintain your racing line, and fight your way toward first place!\n\n## \ud83d\ude97 Explore Exciting Racing Features\n\n\ud83c\udfce\ufe0f **3D Car Racing Experience**\nEnjoy immersive 3D racing gameplay with detailed cars, exciting racing environments, and thrilling competition.\n\n\ud83c\udfc1 **Competitive Car Races**\nRace against other drivers, overtake rival vehicles, and compete for the top position.\n\n\ud83c\udf0d **Exciting Racing Tracks**\nExperience different racing environments featuring challenging roads, sharp corners, exciting turns, and beautiful surroundings.\n\n\ud83c\udfae **Engaging Driving Gameplay**\nTake control of your", "short_description": "Get ready for the ultimate 3D car racing experience! Car Asphalt brings high-speed racing, exciting tracks, powerful sports cars, and thrilling competitions to your screen. Race against rival drivers, conquer sharp turns, explore beautiful racing circuits, and fight for first place.\n\nEnjoy immersive cockpit driving, stunning environments, and action-packed races that test your driving skills. Whether you love car racing games, car driving games, speed racing, or challenging racing tracks"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/rixxxstudio/meta-quest-privacy-policies", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "RexxxStudio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/rixxxstudio/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [],